// native_scene_register.cpp — registers every native of native_scene_decl.h with
// bronze (embed::registerNative) under __bro_native.scene. Generated by brosurface
// (gen/emit_natives.mjs); do not edit. Call registerNatives_scene from registerBroNatives
// (src/bronze_host/host_natives.h) on the thread that runs the program, after registerNatives_animation, registerNatives_rigging, registerNatives_terrain.
//
// Class members are Function-kind natives taking the handle first (the wrapper's
// receiver is dynamic, so a Method-kind registration would be unreachable from it);
// each class has one Constructor-kind registration, which mints the class, and its
// prototype is published as __bro_native.scene.<Class>Proto for scene.js to chain.

